Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix(private-km):=20PR#6=20review=20=E2=80=94=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?BUSINESS=20end=20candidate,=20fail-closed,=20null!=3D0,=20sessi?=
