MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Addresses the 6 review blockers on the AVL16 private-km feature (flag still default OFF):
1. BUSINESS END = candidate captured at privatemode OFF (not a late odometer re-read);
   private_ended_at = OFF boundary. No post-OFF (pro) km can enter private_km (async confirm).
2. Stale OPEN no longer blocks/contaminates next PRIVATE: open_session resolves a residual
   OPEN (DEGRADED close from candidate, else ABANDONED SUPERSEDED_NEW_PRIVATE); BUSINESS
   pending-timeout wires close_from_candidate (DEGRADED, state stays UNKNOWN — no fake confirm).
3. null != 0: _sum_avl16_km returns a number only if >=1 CLOSED session has numeric private_km;
   aggregate branches gate on avl-is-not-None (not session count).
4. Fail-closed partial data: MIXED requires both GPS-before AND AVL16-after measurable else
   UNAVAILABLE; aggregate_private_km_for_scope -> UNAVAILABLE if ANY vehicle unavailable.
5. Tax report scope unions AVL16-only vehicles (CLOSED sessions w/o GPS trips); None never
   coerced to 0 -> PDF renders 'Indisponible'/'—' (reports.py + swiss_tax_report_pdf None-safe).
6. Session opens only if command truly sent: _cmd_effective requires mode==REAL AND applied==True.

Tests: fix-specific 30 + regression 100 = 130/130 PASS. BUSINESS fix + redaction intact.
NO device write / real command / .env prod / deploy. Verified by testing_agent.
